{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15098","headline":"送辽阳使还军 · 李益","name":"送辽阳使还军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征人歌且行，北上辽阳城。\n二月戎马息，悠悠边草生。\n青山出塞断，代地入云平。\n昔者匈奴战，多闻杀汉兵。\n平生报国愤，日夜角弓鸣。\n勉君万里去，勿使虏尘惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}